<title>NETHERLANDS: KLM 1996/97 revenue and costs per sector.</title>
<headline>KLM 1996/97 revenue and costs per sector.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fiscal year to March 31, 1997.</p>
<p>(millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>OPERATING REVENUES</p>
<p>    KLM passenger traffic (billions)    6.78  vs    6.12</p>
<p>    Cargo and mail (billions)	     1.74  vs    1.66</p>
<p>Traffic revenues of other</p>
<p>    consolidated companies		507     vs  505</p>
<p>    Other revenue  (billions)	     1.33  vs    1.25</p>
<p>    Total operating revenues (billion) 10.36  vs    9.54</p>
</text>
